 - Groupleader Warehousing - Born, the Netherlands 
 21 May 2026 Groupleader Warehousing - Born, the Netherlands 
GROUPLEADER WAREHOUSING | BORN, NETHERLANDS | 40 HOUR Are you an experienced leader with a passion for logistics? Do you stand firm, communicate confidently, and want to work for an international logistics service provider? Then this Grouppleader position at Mainfreight Warehousing in Born might be the perfect opportunity for you! 
What will you be doing? 
As a Grouppleader, you are responsible for the daily warehouse operations. You will work at our warehouse location in Born and focus on managing and guiding your team, ensuring that daily operations run smoothly and efficiently. 
Your responsibilities include: 
- Leading a team of logistics TeamMembers; 
- Ensuring efficient planning and optimal staffing levels; 
- Coaching and motivating your team to help them perform at their best; 
- Managing quality, safety, and deadlines; 
- Initiating continuous improvement projects and creating support for change initiatives. 
At Mainfreight, we strongly believe in growth and development. That's why we provide our TeamMembers with ample opportunities to advance within the company. For example, when your supervisor moves into a new role, you - as a Mainfreight TeamMember - will be among the first to have the opportunity to apply. After all, who knows the team better than someone who has experienced all aspects of the job firsthand? 
What are we looking for? 
- Leadership experience within the logistics sector is a strong plus; 
- Excellent communication skills, including a good command of the English language; 
- Decisive, stress-resistant, and persistent - you stay calm under pressure and take action; 
- A flexible mindset with no 9-to-5 mentality - you think in solutions; 
